# Page UI subagents

When improving website UI/UX, read `docs/design/UI_CONSISTENCY_CONTRACT.md` and prefer these project subagents:

- `/ui-page-orchestrator` for multi-page consistency
- `/page-landing`, `/page-workspace`, `/page-focus-room`
- `/page-login`, `/page-signup`, `/page-forgot-password`, `/page-reset-password`, `/page-verify`
- `/page-pricing`, `/page-billing-success`, `/page-billing-cancel`
- `/page-privacy`, `/page-terms`, `/page-404`

Rules:

- UI-only; keep all features and logic
- Shared design across pages via the contract
- Focus Room keeps liquid glass; do not restyle it to marketing/auth cards
- Avoid generic AI-SaaS aesthetics; prefer human Synapse craft
- Browser-test each touched page at desktop and mobile after changes
